  "title": "Devouring Oatmeal Chocolate Chip Cookies",
  "description": "A hearty serving of oats is in each of these chocolate chip cookies. They will disappear quickly in your house!",
  "authors": [
    "gab0291"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:51:04-04:00",
